 4
Create a SYSTEM Trigger that restricts the SCOTT user from
creating only TABLES.
Use ORA_DICT_OBJ_TYPE.
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> CONNECT SYS/password AS SYSDBA;

sql> CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER TRG_NO_TABLE_CREATE
BEFORE CREATE
ON DATABASE

BEGIN

IF USER='SCOTT'
AND ORA_DICT_OBJ_TYPE='TABLE'
THEN

RAISE_APPLICATION_ERROR
(
-20010,
'SCOTT user is not allowed to create TABLES.'
);

END IF;

END;
/

Output:
-------

Trigger created.


====================================================================
Execution
====================================================================

