5
Create a LOGON Trigger that changes the default
date format to DL.
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> CONNECT SYS/password AS SYSDBA;

sql> CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER TRG_LOGON_DL
AFTER LOGON
ON DATABASE

BEGIN

EXECUTE IMMEDIATE
'ALTER SESSION SET NLS_DATE_FORMAT=''DL''';

END;
/

Output:
-------

Trigger created.


